ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nHuang Li and Chen Jie sit in the company's rest area, they are whispering and discussing something. The office door slowly opens, Wang Qiang walks in, he seems to be looking for something, and does not hear the conversation. The conversation between Chen Jie and Huang Li suddenly stops, they quickly switch topics, and start to talk about recent weather changes. As Wang Qiang walks by, Huang Li gives him a slight nod and a polite smile. Chen Jie, while Wang Qiang is not paying attention, quietly gives Huang Li a confirming look. Wang Qiang sits back in his own position, Huang Li and Chen Jie also return to their work, but their eyes still communicate from time to time.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Huang Li smile and nod at Wang Qiang?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Huang Li is affirming to Wang Qiang, she and Chen Jie notice him and may plan to invite him to join a certain project.\nB. Huang Li realizes that Wang Qiang may hear their conversation, and tries to ease the atmosphere.\nC. Huang Li just makes eye contact with Wang Qiang and smiles politely.\nD. Huang Li shows friendliness to Wang Qiang because he is a new employee.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694851968811154,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e090d6006945d27fc619","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367632723,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f724466d7a